 * 闂備浇娉曢崰鎰板几婵犳艾绠柣鎴ｅГ閺呮悂鏌￠崒妯衡偓鏍偓姘秺閺屻劑鎮㈤崨濠勪紕闂佸綊顥撻崗姗€寮幘璇叉闁靛牆妫楅鍫曟⒑鐠恒劌鏋戦柡瀣煼楠炲繘鎮滈懞銉︽闂佸搫鍊堕崐鏍偓姘秺閺屻劑鎮㈤崨濠勪紕闂佸綊顥撻崗姗€寮幘璇叉闁靛牆妫楅鍫曟⒑鐠恒劌鏋戦柡瀣煼楠炲繘鎮滈懞銉︽闂佸搫鍊堕崐鏍偓姘秺閺屻劑鎮㈤崨濠勪紕闂佸綊顥撻崗姗€寮幘璇叉闁靛牆妫楅鍫曟⒑鐠恒劌鏋戦柡瀣煼楠炲繘鎮滈懞銉︽闂佸搫鍊堕崐鏍偓姘秺閺屻劑鎮㈤崨濠勪紕闂佸綊顥撻崗姗€寮幘璇叉闁靛牆妫楅鍫曟⒑鐠恒劌鏋戦柡瀣煼楠炲繘鎮滈懞銉︽闂佸搫鍊堕崐鏍偓姘秺閺屻劑鎮㈤崨濠勪紕闂佸綊顥撻崗姗€寮幘璇叉闁靛牆妫楅鍫曟⒑鐠恒劌鏋戦柡瀣煼楠炲繘鎮滈懞銉︽闂佸搫鍊堕崐鏍偓姘秺閺屻劑鎮㈤崨濠勪紕闂佸綊顥撻崗姗€寮幘璇叉闁靛牆妫楅鍫曟⒑鐠恒劌鏋戦柡瀣煼楠炲繘鎮滈懞銉︽闂佸搫鍊堕崐鏍偓姘秺閺屻劑鎮㈤崨濠勪紕闂佸綊顥撻崗姗€寮幘璇叉闁靛牆妫楅鍫曟⒑鐠恒劌鏋戦柡瀣煼楠炲繘鎮滈懞銉︽闂佸搫鍊堕崐鏍偓姘秺閺屻劑鎮㈤崨濠勪紕闂佸綊顥撻崗姗€寮幘璇叉闁靛牆妫楅鍫曟⒑鐠恒劌鏋戦柡瀣煼楠炲繘鎮滈懞銉︽闂佸搫鍊堕崐鏍偓姘秺閺屻劑鎮㈤崨濠勪紕闂佸綊顥撻崗姗€寮幘璇叉闁靛牆妫楅鍫曟⒑鐠恒劌鏋戦柡瀣煼楠炲繘鎮滈懞銉︽闂佸搫鍊堕崐鏍偓姘秺閺屻劑鎮㈤崨濠勪紕闂佸綊顥撻崗姗€寮幘璇叉闁靛牆妫楅鍫曟⒑鐠恒劌鏋戦柡瀣煼楠炲繘鎮滈懞銉︽闂佸搫鍊堕崐鏍偓姘秺閺屻劑鎮㈤崨濠勪紕闂佸綊顥撻崗姗€寮幘璇叉闁靛牆妫楅锟� */

@keyframes anim-fade-in        { from { opacity: 0; }                              to { opacity: 1; } }
@keyframes anim-fade-out       { from { opacity: 1; }                              to { opacity: 0; } }
@keyframes anim-slide-in-right { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(20px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); } }
@keyframes anim-slide-in-up    { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
@keyframes anim-scale-in       { from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.96); }      to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); } }

.anim-fade-in        { animation: anim-fade-in        var(--ui-duration-base) var(--ui-ease-out)  both; }
.anim-fade-out       { animation: anim-fade-out       var(--ui-duration-base) var(--ui-ease-in)   both; }
.anim-slide-in-right { animation: anim-slide-in-right var(--ui-duration-slow) var(--ui-ease-out)  both; }
.anim-slide-in-up    { animation: anim-slide-in-up    var(--ui-duration-slow) var(--ui-ease-out)  both; }
.anim-scale-in       { animation: anim-scale-in       var(--ui-duration-base) var(--ui-ease-out)  both; }

/* stagger 闂備浇娉曢崰鎰暜鐎靛摜椹抽悷娆忓椤忓爼姊虹捄銊ユ瀾闁哄顭烽獮蹇涙倻閼恒儲娅㈤梺鍝勫€堕崐鏍偓姘秺閺屻劑鎮㈤崨濠勪紕闂佸綊顥撻崗姗€寮幘璇叉闁靛牆妫楅锟� .anim-stagger闂備浇娉曢崰鎰板几婵犳艾绠柣鎴ｅГ閺呮悂鏌￠崒妯衡偓鏍偓姘秺瀹曟宕橀鑺ユ闂佸搫鍊堕崐鏍偓姘秺閺屻劑鎮㈤悜妯兼殾闁荤姳娴囬～澶屸偓姘秺閺屻劑鎮㈤崨濠勪紕闂佸綊顥撻崗姗€濡存惔銊︾叆闁绘柨鎲￠悘顕€鏌熸搴″幋闁轰焦鎹囬幐濠冨緞鐎ｎ厾鐛ラ梻浣芥硶閸犳洟顢氶悩缁樻櫖?0ms 闂備浇娉曢崰鎰板几婵犳艾绠柣鎴ｅГ閺呮悂鏌￠崒妯衡偓鏍偓姘炬嫹*/
.anim-stagger > * { animation: anim-fade-in var(--ui-duration-base) var(--ui-ease-out) both; }
.anim-stagger > *:nth-child(1)  { animation-delay:   0ms; }
.anim-stagger > *:nth-child(2)  { animation-delay:  30ms; }
.anim-stagger > *:nth-child(3)  { animation-delay:  60ms; }
.anim-stagger > *:nth-child(4)  { animation-delay:  90ms; }
.anim-stagger > *:nth-child(5)  { animation-delay: 120ms; }
.anim-stagger > *:nth-child(6)  { animation-delay: 150ms; }
.anim-stagger > *:nth-child(7)  { animation-delay: 180ms; }
.anim-stagger > *:nth-child(8)  { animation-delay: 210ms; }
.anim-stagger > *:nth-child(9)  { animation-delay: 240ms; }
.anim-stagger > *:nth-child(10) { animation-delay: 270ms; }

/* 缂備緡鍨靛畷鐢靛垝濞差亝鐓ラ柣鏂挎啞閻忣噣鏌熸搴″幋闁轰焦鎹囧顒勫Χ閸℃浼� prefers-reduced-motion 闂佸搫鍟悥濂稿极閹捐绠ｆい蹇撴－閺嗘粓鏌熸搴㈢効妞ゃ儱锕弻銊╂偄鐠囨祴鏋忛柣鐘辨祰椤鈧艾缍婇弻銊╂偄閸涘﹦浼勯梺褰掝棑閸忔﹢寮幘璇叉闁靛牆妫楅鍫曟⒑鐠恒劌鏋戦柡瀣煼楠炲繘鎮滈懞銉︽闂佸搫鍊堕崐鏍偓姘秺閺屻劑鎮㈢粙璺ㄦ瀭濡炪倕姘﹀▔娑㈠春閿熺媭鏁嗗┑鐘插暙椤忓爼姊洪敓锟�?*/
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .anim-fade-in, .anim-fade-out, .anim-slide-in-right, .anim-slide-in-up,
  .anim-scale-in, .anim-stagger > * { animation: none !important; }
}

.deploy-canvas-page {
  min-height: 100%;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--ui-space-lg);
  padding: calc(var(--ui-space-2xl) + var(--ui-space-sm)) var(--ui-space-2xl) var(--ui-space-2xl);
  color: var(--ui-text-primary);
  background:
    linear-gradient(135deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 12%, transparent), transparent 42%),
    var(--ui-bg-page);
}

.canvas-hero {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
  align-items: start;
  gap: var(--ui-space-xl);
}

.canvas-title-wrap {
  display: flex;
  gap: var(--ui-space-md);
  align-items: center;
}

.canvas-back {
  width: calc(var(--ui-space-xl) * 2);
  height: calc(var(--ui-space-xl) * 2);
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: 1px solid var(--ui-border-soft);
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-lg);
  background: var(--ui-bg-card);
  color: var(--ui-text-secondary);
}

.canvas-stepper {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--ui-space-xl);
  padding: var(--ui-space-xl) var(--ui-space-2xl);
  border: 1px solid var(--ui-border-default);
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-xl);
  background: var(--ui-bg-card);
  box-shadow: var(--ui-shadow-sm);
}

.canvas-step {
  position: relative;
  flex: 1 1 0;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
  gap: var(--ui-space-md);
  align-items: center;
  min-width: 0;
}

.canvas-step:not(:last-child)::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset-inline-start: calc(100% + calc(var(--ui-space-xl) * 0.5));
  top: 50%;
  width: calc(var(--ui-space-xl) * 1.5);
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--ui-border-default);
  transform: translateX(0);
}

.canvas-step.is-done::after,
.canvas-step.is-current::after {
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 58%, var(--ui-border-default));
}

.canvas-step-dot {
  width: calc(var(--ui-space-xl) * 2);
  height: calc(var(--ui-space-xl) * 2);
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: 1px solid var(--ui-border-default);
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-pill);
  background: var(--ui-bg-card);
  color: var(--ui-text-secondary);
  font-size: var(--ui-font-size-lg);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.canvas-step-dot .lucide {
  width: var(--ui-space-lg);
  height: var(--ui-space-lg);
}

.canvas-step.is-done .canvas-step-dot,
.canvas-step.is-current .canvas-step-dot {
  border-color: var(--ui-color-primary);
  background: var(--ui-color-primary);
  color: var(--ui-text-on-brand);
}

.canvas-step-title {
  color: var(--ui-text-secondary);
  font-weight: 700;
}

.canvas-step.is-done .canvas-step-title,
.canvas-step.is-current .canvas-step-title {
  color: var(--ui-text-primary);
}

.canvas-board {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(calc(var(--ui-space-3xl) * 6), calc(var(--ui-space-3xl) * 8)) minmax(0, 1fr);
  gap: var(--ui-space-lg);
  align-items: start;
}

.canvas-board.is-empty {
  grid-template-columns: minmax(calc(var(--ui-space-3xl) * 6), calc(var(--ui-space-3xl) * 8)) minmax(0, 1fr);
}

.deploy-empty-board {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  min-height: clamp(430px, calc(100vh - 380px), 620px);
  padding: calc(var(--ui-space-3xl) * 1.35) var(--ui-space-2xl);
  border: 1px solid var(--ui-border-soft);
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-xl);
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 8%, transparent), transparent 36%),
    linear-gradient(180deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 4%, var(--ui-bg-card)), var(--ui-bg-card));
  box-shadow: var(--ui-shadow-sm);
}

.deploy-empty-board__inner {
  max-width: 560px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--ui-space-base);
  text-align: center;
}

.deploy-empty-board__icon {
  width: calc(var(--ui-space-3xl) * 1.25);
  height: calc(var(--ui-space-3xl) * 1.25);
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-pill);
  color: var(--ui-color-primary);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 9%, var(--ui-bg-card));
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 24%, var(--ui-border-soft));
  box-shadow: 0 10px 24px color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 12%, transparent);
}

.deploy-empty-board__icon svg {
  width: 28px;
  height: 28px;
}

.deploy-empty-board__copy {
  display: grid;
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
  justify-items: center;
}

.deploy-empty-board__title {
  color: var(--ui-text-primary);
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.35;
}

.deploy-empty-board__desc {
  max-width: min(640px, 92vw);
  color: var(--ui-text-muted);
  line-height: 1.7;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

@media (max-width: 78rem) {
  .deploy-empty-board__desc {
    white-space: normal;
  }
}

.deploy-empty-board__actions {
  margin-top: var(--ui-space-xs);
}

.deploy-empty-board__actions .el-button {
  min-width: 148px;
}

.canvas-panel,
.canvas-inspector {
  border: 1px solid var(--ui-border-soft);
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-xl);
  background: var(--ui-bg-card);
  box-shadow: var(--ui-shadow-sm);
}

.canvas-panel {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-self: start;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.canvas-panel-head {
  padding: var(--ui-space-lg) var(--ui-space-lg) var(--ui-space-base);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ui-border-soft);
}

.canvas-panel-head__main {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 2px;
  min-width: 0;
  flex: 1 1 auto;
}

.canvas-panel-head__main .type-h3,
.canvas-panel-head__main .type-caption {
  white-space: normal;
}

.panel-head-with-action {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: var(--ui-space-md);
  min-height: 0;
}

.canvas-scope-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 10px;
  padding: var(--ui-space-md);
}

.canvas-scope-list.is-empty {
  padding: var(--ui-space-lg);
}

.canvas-scope-scroll {
  flex: none;
  height: auto;
  max-height: min(520px, calc(100vh - 360px));
}

.scope-pill {
  position: relative;
  display: grid;
  align-items: center;
  min-height: 68px;
  padding: 14px 12px 10px;
  border: 1px solid var(--ui-border-soft);
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-lg);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-bg-card) 92%, var(--ui-bg-muted));
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: border-color var(--ui-duration-fast), background var(--ui-duration-fast), box-shadow var(--ui-duration-fast);
}

.scope-pill__main {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 40px minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  width: 100%;
}

.scope-pill__title {
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
  color: var(--ui-text-muted);
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.35;
}

.scope-pill__aside {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-self: end;
  gap: 6px;
  width: 22px;
  min-height: 1px;
}

.scope-corner-actions {
  position: absolute;
  top: 8px;
  right: 10px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  z-index: 1;
}

.scope-status-tag {
  height: auto;
  min-height: auto;
  padding: 0;
  border-radius: 0;
  background: transparent;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.35;
  letter-spacing: 0;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.scope-status-tag::before {
  content: "";
  width: 5px;
  height: 5px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-pill);
  background: currentColor;
  opacity: .72;
}

.scope-pill:hover {
  border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 32%, var(--ui-border-soft));
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 4%, var(--ui-bg-card));
}

.scope-pill.is-active {
  border-color: var(--ui-color-primary);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 7%, var(--ui-bg-card));
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 10%, transparent);
}

.scope-brand-mark {
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-lg);
  background: var(--ui-bg-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--ui-border-soft);
  color: var(--ui-text-muted);
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0;
  box-shadow: var(--ui-shadow-sm);
}

.scope-brand-mark[data-cloud="aliyun"] {
  color: #ff6a00;
  font-size: 0;
}

.scope-brand-mark[data-cloud="aliyun"]::before {
  content: "";
  width: 24px;
  height: 24px;
  border: 5px solid #ff6a00;
  border-left-color: transparent;
  border-right-color: transparent;
  border-radius: 6px;
}

.scope-brand-mark[data-cloud="aws"] {
  color: #232f3e;
}

.scope-brand-mark[data-cloud="google"] {
  color: #4285f4;
}

.scope-brand-mark[data-cloud="huawei"] {
  color: #c7000b;
}

.scope-brand-mark[data-cloud="agione"] {
  color: var(--ui-color-primary);
}

.scope-pill.is-active .scope-brand-mark {
  border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 32%, var(--ui-border-soft));
  background: var(--ui-bg-card);
}

.scope-pill__cloud {
  color: var(--ui-text-primary);
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.scope-pill__region {
  color: var(--ui-text-muted);
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.scope-remove {
  width: 22px;
  height: 22px;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: 1px solid var(--ui-border-soft);
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-sm);
  color: var(--ui-text-muted);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-bg-card) 84%, transparent);
  opacity: .72;
  transition: opacity var(--ui-duration-fast) var(--ui-ease-out),
              color var(--ui-duration-fast) var(--ui-ease-out),
              background var(--ui-duration-fast) var(--ui-ease-out),
              border-color var(--ui-duration-fast) var(--ui-ease-out);
}

.scope-remove-wrap {
  position: absolute;
  right: 12px;
  bottom: 8px;
  display: inline-flex;
  opacity: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  transform: translateY(2px);
  transition: opacity var(--ui-duration-fast) var(--ui-ease-out),
              transform var(--ui-duration-fast) var(--ui-ease-out);
}

.scope-pill.is-active .scope-remove:not(:hover),
.scope-remove:focus:not(:hover) {
  color: var(--ui-text-muted);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-bg-card) 84%, transparent);
  border-color: var(--ui-border-soft);
  opacity: .72;
}

.scope-pill.is-active .scope-remove-wrap {
  opacity: .62;
  pointer-events: auto;
  transform: translateY(0);
}

.scope-pill:hover .scope-remove-wrap,
.scope-remove-wrap:focus-within {
  opacity: 1;
  pointer-events: auto;
  transform: translateY(0);
}

.scope-remove:hover {
  opacity: 1;
  color: var(--ui-color-destructive);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-destructive) 10%, var(--ui-bg-card));
  border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-destructive) 28%, var(--ui-border-soft));
}

.scope-remove [data-lucide] {
  width: 13px;
  height: 13px;
}

.canvas-stage-rail {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
}

.canvas-stage-step {
  display: flex;
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
  align-items: center;
  padding: var(--ui-space-sm);
  border: 1px solid var(--ui-border-soft);
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-lg);
  background: var(--ui-bg-muted);
}

.canvas-stage-step > div {
  min-width: 0;
}

.canvas-stage-step.is-current {
  border-color: var(--ui-color-primary);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 12%, var(--ui-bg-card));
}

.canvas-stage-step.is-done {
  border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-success) 45%, var(--ui-border-soft));
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-success) 8%, var(--ui-bg-card));
}

.stage-marker {
  width: calc(var(--ui-space-lg) + var(--ui-space-sm));
  height: calc(var(--ui-space-lg) + var(--ui-space-sm));
  display: inline-flex;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-pill);
  background: var(--ui-bg-card);
  color: var(--ui-text-muted);
}

.canvas-stage-step.is-current .stage-marker {
  background: var(--ui-color-primary);
  color: var(--ui-text-on-brand);
}

.canvas-stage-step.is-done .stage-marker {
  background: var(--ui-color-success-subtle);
  color: var(--ui-color-success);
}

.canvas-inspector {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.canvas-detail {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.inspector-head {
  padding: var(--ui-space-lg);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ui-border-soft);
  background:
    linear-gradient(135deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 18%, transparent), transparent),
    var(--ui-bg-card);
}

.detail-head-row {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: var(--ui-space-lg);
  align-items: flex-start;
}

.detail-meta-strip {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
  margin-top: var(--ui-space-md);
}

.detail-meta-chip {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--ui-space-xs);
  min-height: calc(var(--ui-space-xl) * 1.35);
  padding: 0 var(--ui-space-md);
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-pill);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 8%, var(--ui-bg-card));
  color: var(--ui-text-secondary);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 22%, var(--ui-border-soft));
}

.detail-stage-rail {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
  margin-top: var(--ui-space-md);
  color: var(--ui-text-muted);
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.4;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.detail-stage-node {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  padding: 2px 0;
  color: var(--ui-text-muted);
  font-weight: 500;
}

.detail-stage-node .detail-stage-label {
  letter-spacing: 0.01em;
}

.detail-stage-node.is-done {
  color: var(--ui-text-primary);
}

.detail-stage-dot {
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-pill);
  background: var(--ui-border-strong);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-border-strong) 18%, transparent);
  transition: background var(--ui-duration-fast), box-shadow var(--ui-duration-fast);
}

.detail-stage-node.is-done .detail-stage-dot {
  background: var(--ui-color-primary);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 22%, transparent);
}

.detail-stage-link {
  flex: 0 0 24px;
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--ui-border-default);
  transition: background var(--ui-duration-fast);
}

.detail-stage-link.is-done {
  background: var(--ui-color-primary);
}

.inspector-body {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--ui-space-lg);
  padding: var(--ui-space-lg);
}

.record-empty-state {
  display: flex;
  min-height: calc(var(--ui-space-3xl) * 3);
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
  padding: var(--ui-space-xl);
  text-align: center;
  border: 1px dashed var(--ui-border-default);
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-lg);
  background: var(--ui-bg-muted);
}

.record-empty-state.is-scope-empty {
  min-height: 168px;
  border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 16%, var(--ui-border-soft));
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-bg-muted) 68%, var(--ui-bg-card));
}

.record-empty-state.is-wide {
  min-height: calc(var(--ui-space-3xl) * 7);
}

.record-empty-icon {
  width: calc(var(--ui-space-xl) * 2);
  height: calc(var(--ui-space-xl) * 2);
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-pill);
  color: var(--ui-color-primary);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 10%, var(--ui-bg-card));
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 28%, var(--ui-border-soft));
}

.record-empty-icon svg {
  width: 22px;
  height: 22px;
}

.global-empty-state {
  min-height: clamp(380px, calc(100vh - 500px), 520px);
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  padding: calc(var(--ui-space-3xl) * 1.35) var(--ui-space-2xl);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 14%, var(--ui-border-soft));
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-xl);
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 32%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 8%, transparent), transparent 35%),
    linear-gradient(180deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 3%, var(--ui-bg-card)), color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-bg-muted) 68%, var(--ui-bg-card)));
}

.global-empty-state__inner {
  max-width: 500px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--ui-space-base);
  text-align: center;
  transform: translateY(-4px);
}

.global-empty-state__icon {
  width: calc(var(--ui-space-3xl) * 1.2);
  height: calc(var(--ui-space-3xl) * 1.2);
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-pill);
  color: var(--ui-color-primary);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 8%, var(--ui-bg-card));
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 22%, var(--ui-border-soft));
  box-shadow: 0 10px 24px color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 12%, transparent);
}

.global-empty-state__icon svg {
  width: 26px;
  height: 26px;
}

.global-empty-state__copy {
  display: grid;
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
  justify-items: center;
}

.global-empty-state__title {
  color: var(--ui-text-primary);
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.4;
}

.global-empty-state__desc {
  max-width: 480px;
  color: var(--ui-text-muted);
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.global-empty-state__actions {
  margin-top: 2px;
}

.global-empty-state__actions .el-button {
  min-width: 148px;
}

.detail-record-body {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0;
  padding: 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--ui-border-soft);
}

.detail-record-body .detail-card {
  border-left: 0;
  border-right: 0;
  border-bottom: 0;
  border-radius: 0;
  padding: var(--ui-space-lg);
  background: transparent;
}

.detail-record-body .detail-card + .detail-card {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--ui-border-soft);
}

.detail-card {
  min-width: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
  padding: var(--ui-space-md);
  border: 1px solid var(--ui-border-soft);
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-xl);
  background: var(--ui-bg-card);
}

.detail-card__head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: var(--ui-space-md);
}

.detail-card__actions {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
}

.detail-card__title {
  min-width: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
}

.detail-card__icon {
  width: calc(var(--ui-space-xl) * 1.6);
  height: calc(var(--ui-space-xl) * 1.6);
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-lg);
  color: var(--ui-color-primary);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 10%, var(--ui-bg-card));
}

.detail-card__empty {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
  min-height: calc(var(--ui-space-3xl) * 2.65);
  padding: var(--ui-space-lg);
  text-align: center;
  border: 1px dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 20%, var(--ui-border-soft));
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-lg);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 3%, var(--ui-bg-card));
}

.detail-card__empty-icon {
  width: calc(var(--ui-space-xl) * 1.7);
  height: calc(var(--ui-space-xl) * 1.7);
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-pill);
  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 82%, var(--ui-text-muted));
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 8%, var(--ui-bg-card));
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 18%, var(--ui-border-soft));
}

.detail-card__empty-text {
  max-width: 420px;
  color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-text-muted) 86%, var(--ui-text-secondary));
}

.kv-stack {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0;
}

.kv-value-mono {
  display: block;
  max-height: calc(var(--ui-space-3xl) * 1.6);
  padding: var(--ui-space-sm);
  border: 1px solid var(--ui-border-soft);
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-md);
  background: var(--ui-bg-muted);
  font-family: var(--ui-font-mono);
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.55;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  overflow: auto;
}

.kv-inline-action {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
  min-width: 0;
}

.model-intake-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
  margin-top: var(--ui-space-xs);
}

.model-intake-field {
  min-width: 0;
  display: grid;
  align-content: start;
  gap: 4px;
  min-height: 64px;
  padding: var(--ui-space-sm) var(--ui-space-md);
  border: 1px solid var(--ui-border-soft);
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-lg);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-bg-muted) 54%, var(--ui-bg-card));
}

.model-intake-field.is-wide {
  grid-column: span 2;
}

.model-intake-field.is-full {
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
}

.model-intake-command {
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
  margin-top: 0;
}

.model-intake-label {
  color: var(--ui-text-muted);
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.35;
}

.model-intake-value {
  min-width: 0;
  color: var(--ui-text-primary);
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.45;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.model-intake-field--compact {
  min-height: 56px;
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-bg-card) 72%, var(--ui-bg-muted));
}

.model-source-status {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  color: var(--ui-text-primary);
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.45;
}

.model-source-status__icon {
  width: 14px;
  height: 14px;
  color: var(--ui-color-primary);
  flex: 0 0 auto;
}

.detail-card .inspector-kv {
  padding: var(--ui-space-xs) 0;
}

.resource-stack {
  display: flex;
  min-width: 0;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--ui-space-lg);
}

.resource-block {
  display: flex;
  min-width: 0;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
}

.resource-block__head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: var(--ui-space-md);
}

.inspector-task {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--ui-space-md);
  padding: var(--ui-space-md);
  border: 1px solid var(--ui-border-soft);
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-lg);
  background: var(--ui-bg-muted);
}

.inspector-task.is-current {
  border-color: var(--ui-color-primary);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 12%, var(--ui-bg-card));
}

.inspector-task.is-done {
  border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-success) 45%, var(--ui-border-soft));
}

.task-icon {
  width: calc(var(--ui-space-lg) + var(--ui-space-md));
  height: calc(var(--ui-space-lg) + var(--ui-space-md));
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-pill);
  background: var(--ui-bg-card);
  color: var(--ui-text-muted);
}

.inspector-task.is-current .task-icon {
  background: var(--ui-color-primary);
  color: var(--ui-text-on-brand);
}

.inspector-task.is-done .task-icon {
  background: var(--ui-color-success-subtle);
  color: var(--ui-color-success);
}

.inspector-section {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
}

.inspector-summary-card {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
  gap: var(--ui-space-md);
  align-items: center;
  padding: var(--ui-space-md);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-success) 42%, var(--ui-border-soft));
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-lg);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-success) 8%, var(--ui-bg-card));
}

.inspector-summary-icon {
  width: calc(var(--ui-space-xl) * 2);
  height: calc(var(--ui-space-xl) * 2);
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-pill);
  background: var(--ui-color-success-subtle);
  color: var(--ui-color-success);
}

.inspector-form-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
}

.inspector-field {
  display: flex;
  min-width: 0;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--ui-space-xs);
}

.inspector-input {
  min-height: calc(var(--ui-space-xl) * 1.8);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  min-width: 0;
  padding: 0 var(--ui-space-md);
  border: 1px solid var(--ui-border-default);
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-md);
  background: var(--ui-input);
  color: var(--ui-text-secondary);
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.inspector-radio-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
}

.inspector-radio {
  min-height: calc(var(--ui-space-xl) * 1.8);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: 1px solid var(--ui-border-default);
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-md);
  background: var(--ui-bg-muted);
  color: var(--ui-text-secondary);
}

.inspector-radio.is-active {
  border-color: var(--ui-color-primary);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 12%, var(--ui-bg-card));
  color: var(--ui-color-primary);
}

.inspector-action-card {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
  gap: var(--ui-space-md);
  align-items: center;
  padding: var(--ui-space-md);
  border: 1px dashed color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 38%, var(--ui-border-soft));
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-lg);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 6%, var(--ui-bg-card));
}

.detail-local-actions {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: var(--ui-space-lg);
  padding: var(--ui-space-base) var(--ui-space-lg);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--ui-border-soft);
  background: var(--ui-bg-card);
}

.detail-local-actions-copy {
  min-width: 0;
}

.detail-local-buttons {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
}

.inspector-button-row {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
}

.inspector-kv {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(calc(var(--ui-space-3xl) * 2), auto) minmax(0, 1fr);
  gap: var(--ui-space-md);
  padding: var(--ui-space-sm) 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ui-border-soft);
}

.inspector-kv:last-child {
  border-bottom: 0;
}

.dialog-scope-note {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
  margin-bottom: var(--ui-space-lg);
  padding: var(--ui-space-md);
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 24%, var(--ui-border-soft));
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-lg);
  color: var(--ui-text-secondary);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 7%, var(--ui-bg-card));
}

.dialog-subtle-note {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--ui-space-xs);
  margin: -2px 0 var(--ui-space-md);
  color: var(--ui-text-muted);
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.dialog-subtle-note [data-lucide] {
  width: 16px;
  height: 16px;
  color: var(--ui-color-primary);
}

.dialog-context-line {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
  max-width: 100%;
  min-height: 30px;
  margin: 2px 0 var(--ui-space-lg);
  padding: 5px 10px;
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 14%, var(--ui-border-soft));
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-md);
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 4%, var(--ui-bg-card));
  color: var(--ui-text-muted);
}

.dialog-context-label {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  color: var(--ui-text-muted);
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.35;
}

.dialog-context-main {
  min-width: 0;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  color: var(--ui-text-secondary);
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.35;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.dialog-context-main [data-lucide] {
  width: 13px;
  height: 13px;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  color: var(--ui-text-muted);
}

.dialog-form {
  margin-bottom: var(--ui-space-sm);
}

.dialog-form .el-select {
  width: 100%;
}

.dialog-form-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: var(--ui-space-md);
}

.dialog-form-grid.is-three {
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
}

.location-picker {
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--ui-space-md);
}

.location-picker__head {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: nowrap;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
  margin-bottom: var(--ui-space-md);
  padding-bottom: var(--ui-space-sm);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ui-border-soft);
}

.location-picker__head .location-picker__label {
  margin-right: var(--ui-space-xs);
  color: var(--ui-text-muted);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}

.location-picker__filters {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: nowrap;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: flex-start;
  gap: var(--ui-space-sm);
}

.location-picker__reset {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--ui-space-xs);
  padding: 4px 8px;
  border: 0;
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--ui-color-primary);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 1.4;
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-md);
  margin-left: var(--ui-space-xs);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background var(--ui-duration-fast), color var(--ui-duration-fast);
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.location-picker__reset:hover {
  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 10%, transparent);
}

.location-picker__reset:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ui-color-primary) 36%, transparent);
  outline-offset: 2px;
}

.location-picker__reset[disabled] {
  color: var(--ui-text-disabled);
  cursor: not-allowed;
  background: transparent;
}

.location-filter-select {
  width: 152px;
  min-width: 152px;
  max-width: 152px;
  flex: 0 0 152px;
}

.location-filter-select .el-select__wrapper {
  min-height: 32px;
  padding-left: 10px;
  padding-right: 10px;
  border-radius: var(--ui-radius-md);
  background: transparent;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--ui-border-soft) inset;
}

.location-filter-select .el-select__wrapper.is-hovering:not(.is-focused) {
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--ui-border-default) inset;
}

.location-filter-select .el-select__wrapper.is-focused {
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--ui-color-primary) inset;
}

.location-filter-select [data-lucide] {
  width: 14px;
  height: 14px;
  color: var(--ui-text-muted);
}

.location-picker__scroll {
  max-height: 360px;
  border: 1px solid var(--ui-border-soft);
